{
    "chunks": [
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 2.0,
            "text": " Yes sir, I am trying."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 2.0,
            "end": 4.0,
            "text": " Yes sir, yes. It's not working."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 4.0,
            "end": 6.0,
            "text": " Yes sir, I tried putting it inside."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 6.0,
            "end": 8.0,
            "text": " Still it's not working."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 8.0,
            "end": 10.0,
            "text": " What are you saying? I don't know if it's working."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 10.0,
            "end": 12.0,
            "text": " Why would I do it from outside?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 12.0,
            "end": 14.0,
            "text": " He's giving me a tablet. What will I do with the tablet?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 14.0,
            "end": 16.0,
            "text": " Okay, I'll try again."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 16.0,
            "end": 18.0,
            "text": " I'll do it after breakfast. I don't have energy now."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 18.0,
            "end": 20.0,
            "text": " What is he saying?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 20.0,
            "end": 22.0,
            "text": " It's not working?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 22.0,
            "end": 24.0,
            "text": " Oh!"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 24.0,
            "end": 26.0,
            "text": " That's why he was saying it again and again."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 26.0,
            "end": 28.0,
            "text": " That not now, dad."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 28.0,
            "end": 30.0,
            "text": " Let the business get set, then we'll do it."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 30.0,
            "end": 32.0,
            "text": " But the real thing was that"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 32.0,
            "end": 34.0,
            "text": " he's asking for a doctor's advice."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 42.0,
            "end": 44.0,
            "text": " Listen. Yes, tell me."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 44.0,
            "end": 46.0,
            "text": " It's not working."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 46.0,
            "end": 48.0,
            "text": " What's not working?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 48.0,
            "end": 50.0,
            "text": " Oh, that's not working."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 50.0,
            "end": 52.0,
            "text": " What are you doing? We have kids who are unmarried."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 52.0,
            "end": 54.0,
            "text": " What kind of gestures are you making?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 54.0,
            "end": 56.0,
            "text": " You start thinking about everything."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 56.0,
            "end": 58.0,
            "text": " It's not working for both of them."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 58.0,
            "end": 60.0,
            "text": " Really?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 60.0,
            "end": 62.0,
            "text": " Yes. He was talking to the doctor."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 62.0,
            "end": 64.0,
            "text": " And he's taking pills."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 66.0,
            "end": 68.0,
            "text": " Listen. This is a very difficult thing."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 68.0,
            "end": 70.0,
            "text": " Yes, it is."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 70.0,
            "end": 72.0,
            "text": " I don't know what kind of a son you have given birth to."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 72.0,
            "end": 74.0,
            "text": " He's not even having a child."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 74.0,
            "end": 76.0,
            "text": " So what's my fault? You're also a murderer."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 76.0,
            "end": 78.0,
            "text": " Do one thing."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 78.0,
            "end": 80.0,
            "text": " Talk to both of them in your own way."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 80.0,
            "end": 82.0,
            "text": " No, I won't talk. You're the mother. You talk."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 82.0,
            "end": 84.0,
            "text": " But you're also a father."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 84.0,
            "end": 86.0,
            "text": " You can also talk."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 86.0,
            "end": 88.0,
            "text": " No, I won't talk. You talk."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 88.0,
            "end": 90.0,
            "text": " So, let's do one thing."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 90.0,
            "end": 92.0,
            "text": " Let's talk to them in person."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 94.0,
            "end": 96.0,
            "text": " Yes, that's a good idea."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 114.0,
            "end": 116.0,
            "text": " What do you think?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 116.0,
            "end": 118.0,
            "text": " What do you think?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 118.0,
            "end": 120.0,
            "text": " You're thinking what I'm thinking."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 120.0,
            "end": 122.0,
            "text": " Right?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 122.0,
            "end": 124.0,
            "text": " I'm thinking the same."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 124.0,
            "end": 126.0,
            "text": " So, the daughter-in-law is in trouble."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 126.0,
            "end": 128.0,
            "text": " Do one thing."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 128.0,
            "end": 130.0,
            "text": " You talk to her."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 130.0,
            "end": 132.0,
            "text": " No, you also do it."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 132.0,
            "end": 134.0,
            "text": " This is a woman's thing. You talk."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 134.0,
            "end": 136.0,
            "text": " I'll do it."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 138.0,
            "end": 140.0,
            "text": " Son."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 140.0,
            "end": 142.0,
            "text": " Are you okay?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 142.0,
            "end": 144.0,
            "text": " Yes, mom. I'm absolutely fine."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 144.0,
            "end": 146.0,
            "text": " What happened to Saqib?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 146.0,
            "end": 148.0,
            "text": " He's been"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 148.0,
            "end": 150.0,
            "text": " looking worried since morning."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 150.0,
            "end": 152.0,
            "text": " Saqib's system is broken."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 152.0,
            "end": 154.0,
            "text": " What?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 154.0,
            "end": 156.0,
            "text": " What's broken?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 156.0,
            "end": 158.0,
            "text": " System."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 158.0,
            "end": 160.0,
            "text": " And if someone's system is broken, he won't be worried."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 166.0,
            "end": 168.0,
            "text": " I thought"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 168.0,
            "end": 170.0,
            "text": " your system is broken."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 170.0,
            "end": 172.0,
            "text": " I don't have any system."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 172.0,
            "end": 174.0,
            "text": " Something must be wrong."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 176.0,
            "end": 178.0,
            "text": " What happened?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 188.0,
            "end": 190.0,
            "text": " Tell me what happened?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 190.0,
            "end": 192.0,
            "text": " Tell me quickly. I want to cook."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 192.0,
            "end": 194.0,
            "text": " I was saying that..."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 200.0,
            "end": 202.0,
            "text": " Your mom will tell you."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 204.0,
            "end": 206.0,
            "text": " You tell me."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 206.0,
            "end": 208.0,
            "text": " Do your work."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 208.0,
            "end": 210.0,
            "text": " Sit."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 210.0,
            "end": 212.0,
            "text": " I'll tell you."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 212.0,
            "end": 214.0,
            "text": " Tell me."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 214.0,
            "end": 216.0,
            "text": " It'll be done."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 216.0,
            "end": 218.0,
            "text": " Don't worry."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 218.0,
            "end": 220.0,
            "text": " What will happen?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 220.0,
            "end": 222.0,
            "text": " I don't know."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 222.0,
            "end": 224.0,
            "text": " Oh, I see."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 224.0,
            "end": 226.0,
            "text": " I know it'll be done."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 226.0,
            "end": 228.0,
            "text": " I'm not worried."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 228.0,
            "end": 230.0,
            "text": " I know you'll talk about it."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 232.0,
            "end": 234.0,
            "text": " Son,"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 234.0,
            "end": 236.0,
            "text": " I was saying that"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 236.0,
            "end": 238.0,
            "text": " I know a sage."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 238.0,
            "end": 240.0,
            "text": " Let's show him."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 240.0,
            "end": 242.0,
            "text": " What can a sage do?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 242.0,
            "end": 244.0,
            "text": " There's nothing"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 244.0,
            "end": 246.0,
            "text": " that a sage can't do."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 246.0,
            "end": 248.0,
            "text": " It's not a small thing. It's a big thing."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 248.0,
            "end": 250.0,
            "text": " If there's a problem, show it."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 250.0,
            "end": 252.0,
            "text": " I'm showing it."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 252.0,
            "end": 254.0,
            "text": " The engineer will come and check."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 254.0,
            "end": 256.0,
            "text": " Problem solved."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 256.0,
            "end": 258.0,
            "text": " What's going on?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 258.0,
            "end": 260.0,
            "text": " One minute."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 260.0,
            "end": 262.0,
            "text": " Why will the engineer come?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 262.0,
            "end": 264.0,
            "text": " The doctor will solve this problem."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 264.0,
            "end": 266.0,
            "text": " Call the doctor."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 266.0,
            "end": 268.0,
            "text": " What will the engineer do?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 268.0,
            "end": 270.0,
            "text": " I was saying that"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 270.0,
            "end": 272.0,
            "text": " we should call the sage at home."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 274.0,
            "end": 276.0,
            "text": " What?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 276.0,
            "end": 278.0,
            "text": " What's going on?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 278.0,
            "end": 280.0,
            "text": " What sage? What doctor?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 280.0,
            "end": 282.0,
            "text": " The wifi antenna will be damaged."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 282.0,
            "end": 284.0,
            "text": " The engineer will fix it."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 286.0,
            "end": 288.0,
            "text": " Our son is so innocent."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 288.0,
            "end": 290.0,
            "text": " Forget the wifi antenna."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 290.0,
            "end": 292.0,
            "text": " Fix your antenna first."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 292.0,
            "end": 294.0,
            "text": " I mean,"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 294.0,
            "end": 296.0,
            "text": " if it's not working,"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 296.0,
            "end": 298.0,
            "text": " show it to the doctor."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 298.0,
            "end": 300.0,
            "text": " What's not working?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 300.0,
            "end": 302.0,
            "text": " The kid."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 302.0,
            "end": 304.0,
            "text": " Whose kid?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 304.0,
            "end": 306.0,
            "text": " Yours."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 306.0,
            "end": 308.0,
            "text": " You? When did I say that?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 308.0,
            "end": 310.0,
            "text": " Why do you keep talking nonsense?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 310.0,
            "end": 312.0,
            "text": " I didn't say anything."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 312.0,
            "end": 314.0,
            "text": " You didn't tell the doctor that it's not working."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 314.0,
            "end": 316.0,
            "text": " When did I tell the doctor that it's not working?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 316.0,
            "end": 318.0,
            "text": " Why didn't you say that you're taking pills?"
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
            "title": "Ho Nahi Raha",
            "start": 318.0,
            "end": 320.0,
            "text": " I was talking to my boss."
        },
        {
            "number": "1",
